## 2) Pick a **reference component** to clone (not LinkBox-specific)

Choose **any** component in **`{{serializationRoot}}`** that already has the same **item shape** you need (datasource template + folder template + parameters + Json Rendering; optional placeholder settings).

| Placeholder                        | Meaning                                                                                                                      |
| ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `{{referenceSitecoreBaseName}}`    | That component’s short name (e.g. `LinkBoxCard`, `Title`, `Promo`—whatever exists in YAML)                                   |
| `{{referenceSerializationPrefix}}` | Repo prefix to its files, e.g. `{{serializationRoot}}templatesProject/{{sitecoreProjectKey}}/{{referenceSitecoreBaseName}}/` |

**Clone `Template:` / `Parent:` / `SharedFields` shapes** from the reference YAML; **generate new GUIDs** for every new item and fix all `Parent` / cross-references. Do **not** copy IDs from the reference into new items.

---

## Mandatory: YAML change log

For every create/update/delete:

### YAML change log

| Repo file                | Action                   | What changed                                                                                |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `{{serializationRoot}}…` | create / update / delete | Concrete hints: `componentName`, new field `Hint`, `Path:`, `__Masters`, deleted file, etc. |

Rules:

- **Create** — list each new file and main fields set.
- **Update** — each file + semantic before/after (e.g. “removed field YAML; TSX dropped prop”).
- **Delete** — path + reason.
- New IDs must be **unique** across the module.

