## Template field rules (field definition YAML)

- **Image** — appropriate Sitecore type; **Source** `query:$siteMedia`; **Shared** when your vertical’s pattern requires it.
- **Rich Text** — Source `query:$xaRichTextProfile`.
- **General Link** — Source `query:$linkableHomes`; **Shared** when required.
- Other types — match existing patterns in **`{{referenceSerializationPrefix}}`**.

---

## Standard values

- Link fields: follow your vertical’s serialized link pattern (often home by ID).
- Image defaults: `<image mediaid="{GUID}" />` only when a media item exists in YAML.
- Keep datasource field items **1:1** with the TSX `fields` / `Fields` contract.

