## Final checklist

1. **### YAML change log** (mandatory).
2. Full list of paths under **`{{serializationRoot}}`** touched.
3. **Component map** entry updated when adding a new rendering.
4. **Available Renderings** — when serialized for the site, **`Renderings`** (`715ae6c0-71c8-4744-ab4f-65362d20ad65`) includes every new **`projectRenderings`** item **ID** (pipe-separated list; YAML may use one `{GUID}` per line).
5. **New YAML** — **`__Owner`**, **`__Created by`**, and **`__Updated by`** set to **`{{sitecoreAuthorAccount}}`** (SitecoreSilver default: `sitecore\johan.becue@sitecore.com`); see **New YAML files: audit / user fields**.
6. **Site `Data/` content YAML** — root **`Template:`** on each item: **Folder** template id for list folders, **inner** datasource template id for leaf items (see Step 6 table); must match `templatesProject/...` **`ID:`** values, not copy-paste from a different component.
7. Remind user to run **Sitecore CLI** sync if your pipeline requires it.
8. **Site chrome** — if header/footer/global bar: **Step 10** partial design + page design `PartialDesigns`; do not duplicate on every page.

